// Team View – shared metadata & client-side grouping helpers
//
// The Team screen re-frames each *profile* as an AI "team member". It speaks
// manager language (roles, departments, skills) instead of raw technical
// concepts (category, file_match, api_settings).
//
// NOTE: the profiles API has no notion of a "department". Members are grouped
// client-side and the assignment map is persisted per project in localStorage.
// When the API exposes a real team field only the helpers below need to change —
// the views read grouping exclusively through them.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

